# .mailmap — canonicalize author identities for git shortlog, git log,
# GitHub's contributors graph/widget, and any other tool that honors
# this file. Maps the per-user noreply addresses (and any future stray
# attribution) back to each contributor's canonical name + email.
#
# Format (see `git help mailmap`):
#   Proper Name <proper@email>
#   <proper@email> <commit@email>
#   Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>
#   Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

